  "title": "How AI Learns: Neural Networks and Training, Explained Simply",
  "cover_text": "HOW AI LEARNS",
  "description": "How does AI learn? Neural networks, layers, and the guess, check, adjust loop called training, explained simply.\n\nA dad asks, his teen daughter explains: what a neural network really is, how its layers spot edges, shapes and objects, how tiny dials get nudged after every mistake, and why good training data matters so much. Then a quick quiz to test yourself.\n\nWant the 60-second version? It's on our Shorts tab.\n\nAInation Studio — AI, explained simply for families. Subscribe: https://www.youtube.com/@AI.nationstudio",
